{"title":"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/1/04140f5fc853a299eeb7d6a45af1c171fe35dfbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = x^{(x+1)}(x+2)^{(x+3)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"194\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/0/74016284ee81fd7d25a793fb52c04a78af0d4301.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0)+f(-1)+f(-2)+f(-3) =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"264\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/6/f46f0f8584a8b612b9527d91b26209cc2befe1fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ -\\frac{8}{9}\\qquad\\text{(B)}\\ 0\\qquad\\text{(C)}\\ \\frac{8}{9}\\qquad\\text{(D)}\\ 1\\qquad\\text{(E)}\\ \\frac{10}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"372\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ea5b6f6de584d56d19a89cc4923a9d9a5cfa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> into the function will give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/c/69cf472955e8a7b7a7101c08cb0c7d37fc1fb5de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0^1\\cdot 2^3$\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/c/25c4feb49390983f1b11a91c90ca80308dc3130e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0^1 = 0$\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />, this gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86c2e8c17cff668023b2f29f2e95e4a0fafa6271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> into the function will give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/0/6706f74ac36028dfb0f2150642928ce0bd125cd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1)^0 \\cdot 1^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"19\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/a/a2ab5246065488a2ef7f7678ee43c524fb48b7fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1)^0 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"80\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/2/312d643c239f9fd6054701a8cba664779329cf72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />, this gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/2/f226eebf91a88812cbbed46cd0a97e67530a7494.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> will give a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba5f1455942544fc2a086c4645ef8b605282391.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0^1$\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" /> factor as the second term, giving an answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/c/2fc52914d6fade6cb0f0f830a05d31585700f7ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-3$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> will give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/0/e805d730f1ac6c68533801aa7cd2dde164046df4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-3)^{-2}\\cdot (-1)^0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"19\" />.  The last term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, while the first term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/f/cdfef109990bc5c89e223b55c43a2854e9470f62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{(-3)^2} = \\frac{1}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"84\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Adding up all four values, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/9/cd9fd4dc9de1bf464ecd8ec954ed1723022f2f59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + \\frac{1}{9} = \\frac{10}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"89\" height=\"37\" />, and the right answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME\" title=\"1996 AHSME\">1996 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1996 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1996\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1996_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1996 AHSME Problems/Proble